# EC2 3-Server SSH Setup

This guide explains how to configure passwordless SSH between three AWS EC2 instances.

The setup allows:
- Server-1 to SSH into Server-2 and Server-3  
- Server-2 to SSH into Server-1 and Server-3  
- Server-3 to SSH into Server-1 and Server-2  

All three EC2 servers can SSH into each other without using passwords.  
This setup is useful for automation, deployments, and cluster environments.
